<p>Man, that was good! I think the format screw works wonderfully, as both a containment procedure and as a plot device. And although I was confused at first, I’m really glad I finished it. I’ll definitely be exploring more of the choices it offers.</p>
<p>As for the premature upvote, it was mainly a vote of confidence given, to me at least, if it takes 30-60 minutes to upload all of its parts, you’re surely in for a good time!</p>

